  "ingredients": [
    "3 eggs",
    "1 cup milk",
    "1 cup all-purpose flour"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs and milk together in large bowl. Beat in flour until batter is smooth. Lightly coat an 8 inch skillet or crepe pan on medium-high heat with cooking spray. Make one pancake at a time by dropping a large spoonful of batter onto pan and tilting to cover the whole surface of the pan evenly. Cook until golden, turning once, about 2 minutes per pancake.",
